# FE-226: the commit subject gate at the source -- one regex, no node,
# no install, safe to run on every commit. Allowed subjects:
#   "FE-226: short English description" (BE-194 part 10: for backend
#   slices, "FE-200, FE-201:" when one commit closes several tasks) or
#   "short description (owner 2026-11-21)" for owner-requested work
#   without a Linear task. Merge/revert subjects pass through.
# The body stays free-form; the "Task: FE-NNN" trailer is the tooling's.
# Bypass via --no-verify closes at CI (the commit-msg workflow).
scripts/check-commit-msg.sh "$1"
